Hotels and motels are subject to the following:
(a) The proposed lot shall have a minimum lot area of 800 square feet per guest unit;
(b) No building or structure shall be located less than 25 feet from an adjoining rear and side property line;
(c) No exterior display or advertising shall be displayed, except those signs permitted in accordance with Article 17;
(d) The following accessory uses may be permitted subject to all applicable regulations of this Ordinance:
